# Normalise line endings so the repository looks identical on every platform
# 统一换行符，确保仓库在任何平台上表现一致
* text=auto eol=lf

*.md   text diff=markdown
*.yml  text
*.yaml text
*.txt  text

# Binary assets
# 二进制资源
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.apk binary
*.zip binary

# Keep documentation out of language statistics
# 让语言统计忽略纯文档目录
docs/**   linguist-documentation
assets/** linguist-documentation
